  "findings": [
    "A common EvidenceObservation envelope can preserve these heterogeneous receipts if verifier-specific facts remain opaque structured payloads.",
    "A single scalar standing cannot distinguish verification result, profile authority, evidence completeness, trust authenticity, release readiness and consumer-domain acceptance.",
    "Consumer smoke standing is external to Artifact kernel even when it embeds Artifact verification PASS.",
    "Presentation frozen acceptance can be projected as multiple observations, but the selected manifest is an aggregate acceptance artifact rather than the raw verify-stage receipt set; this projection must not be treated as proof that every historical raw receipt shares one schema.",
    "Document remains represented at request-model level in this slice because no selected frozen document receipt was used; no evidence-shape claim is inferred for it."
  ],
